*      FUNCTION REPR/INIT.  I=INIT(NAME,M,-(J*200+K)).                  SASP0137
*                                                                       SASP0138
*      ROUTINES SEARCH TRACE TABLE FROM J TO K FOR MTH OCCURENCE OF NAMESASP0139
*      IF 3RD ARGUMENT(MUST BE NEGATIVE) HAS AB. VALUE LESS THAN 200.   SASP0140
*      ROUTINES SEARCH ALL TRACE TABLE UP TO FIRST ZERO.  IF 3RD ARG. =0SASP0141
*      OR MTH OCCURENCE DOESN-T APPEAR, FUNCTION=0.  INIT=((I+1)*200+L) SASP0142
*      WHERE I=INDEX OF MTH APPEARANCE, AND L=RANGE OF NAME (GREATER THASASP0143
*      REPR=-(I*2**18+J),WHERE I=ILO,AND J=IHIGH, FROM TRACE ELEMENTS.  SASP0144
*                                                                       SASP0145
*      P.B.BURLESON  8/1/62                                             SASP0146
*                                                                       SASP0147
       ENTRY   INIT                                                     SASP0148
       ENTRY   IREPR                                                    SASP0149
       ENTRY   REPR                                                     SASP0150
IREPR  NOP                                                              SASP0151
REPR   CLA     REPR1                                                    SASP0152
