GO     TSX     $LOCATE,4                                                SASP0178
A      TSX                                                              SASP0179
       TSX                                                              SASP0180
       TSX                                                              SASP0181
       NOP                                                              SASP0182
       TZE     OUT                                                      SASP0183
       STD     KEEP                                                     SASP0184
